ies</surname><given-names>RS</given-names></name><name><surname>Heimann</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Ojima</surname><given-names>DS</given-names></name><name><surname>Quegan</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Schmullius</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Model-data synthesis in terrestrial carbon observation: methods, data requirements and data uncertainty specifications</article-title><source>Glob Change Biol</source><year>2005</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>378</fpage><lpage>397</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1365-2486.2005.00917.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gruber</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Keeling</surname><given-names>CD</given-names></name><name><surname>Bates</surname><given-names>NR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Interannual variability in the North Atlantic Ocean carbon sink</article-title><source>Science</source><year>2002</year><volume>298</volume><fpage>2374</fpage><lpage>2378</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12493911</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1126/science.1077077</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sabine</surname><given-names>CL</given-names></name><name><surname>Feely</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Gruber</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Key</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Bullister</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Wanninkhof</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Wong</surname><given-names>CS</given-names></name><name><surname>Wallace</surname><given-names>DWR</given-names></name><name><surname>Tilbrook<